IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-periods`
IMPORT `sgk-div8-application`
IMPORT `sgk-div8-registration`

-- Tests for ss 131 to 133. Every expected value is written from the text of the section, beside the assertion.

§ `The charges used in the tests`
-- Fixtures: one charge each, written with positional OF. The ruler names the columns in the order of the record.
--   byco, date, deb, uncalled, subshares, billofsale, land, rent, book, negot, float, calls, ship, goodwill, aircraft, old3, lien, wind, vol, cred
`charge: a debenture charge` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on uncalled share capital` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on subsidiary shares` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a bill of sale charge` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on land` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a rent charge on land` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on book debts` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on a negotiable instrument` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on a negotiable instrument and a floating charge` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a floating charge` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on calls` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on a ship` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on goodwill` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: no listed charge` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge by a non-company` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF FALSE, Date 1 6 2020, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on aircraft registrable under the aircraft act` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge on aircraft not registrable under the aircraft act` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2020, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge created on 2 January 2016 with no old head` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 2 1 2016, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge created on 3 January 2016` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 3 1 2016, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge created on 2 January 2016 within the old subsection (3)` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 2 1 2016, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge created in 2015 within the old subsection (3) but no current head` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2015, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`charge: a charge created in 2015 with a current head but not within the old subsection (3)` MEANS `s 131(3) the facts about the charge` OF TRUE, Date 1 6 2015, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
